        by 0x558BE5: dix_main (main.c:276)
        by 0x7C4B1BA: (below main) (libc-start.c:308)
      Block was alloc'd at
        at 0x4C2FB06: calloc (vg_replace_malloc.c:711)
        by 0x42B307: xwl_realize_window (xwayland.c:488)
