      (EE) 7: /usr/bin/Xwayland (dix_main+0x3b3) [0x544ef3]
      (EE) 6: /usr/bin/Xwayland (Dispatch+0x31e) [0x54109e]
      (EE) 5: /usr/bin/Xwayland (ProcRRGetMonitors+0x9b) [0x4ca18b]
