    e.g. LIBGL_ALWAYS_INDIRECT=1  ./glean -r results -o --quick -t "fpexceptions
    getString" fails with a BadContextTag error.
    
    Signed-off-by: Jon TURNEY <jon.turney@dronecode.org.uk>
